            <ArticleTitle>A comparison of corneal topographical changes induced by corneal lens wear and keratoconus.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1161-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A distinction is made between keratoconus-like changes induced by physical pressures placed on the cornea by hard corneal lens wear and the simultaneous development of true keratoconus in contact lens wearers.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
